.TH tkulabeled n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkulabeled
.PP
Labeled input composites \-\- a "label + control" row you drop into any layout, for when a full \fBtkuform\fR dict is more than you need. The widget is the frame at \fB$path\fR; the inner control is reachable, and one \fBvalue\fR accessor reads/writes it. Types: entry, combo, spin, check, text. Pure Tk.
.SS API
.CS
::tkutils::tkulabeled::add $path $type \
    ?-label s? ?-labelwidth n? ?-orient horizontal|vertical? ?control opts...?
::tkutils::tkulabeled::value $path ?newValue?   ;# get (1 arg) or set (2 args)
::tkutils::tkulabeled::control     $path        ;# the inner control widget
::tkutils::tkulabeled::labelwidget $path        ;# the ttk::label
::tkutils::tkulabeled::configure   $path ?-label s? ?control opts...?
.CE
.PP
\fB$type\fR is one of \fBentry combo spin check text\fR \-\- passed as a value, so nothing here shadows a Tcl/Tk builtin. Options other than \fB\-label\fR/\fB\-labelwidth\fR/ \fB\-orient\fR are forwarded to the inner control (\fB\-values\fR, \fB\-from\fR/\fB\-to\fR, \fB\-variable\fR, \fB\-width\fR, \fB\-height\fR, …). \fBtext\fR defaults to a vertical layout.
.CS
package require tkutils::tkulabeled
tkulabeled::add .name  entry -label "Name:" -labelwidth 10
tkulabeled::add .lang  combo -label "Lang:" -values {Tcl Tk C}
tkulabeled::add .age   spin  -label "Age:"  -from 0 -to 120
tkulabeled::add .vip   check -label "VIP"   -variable ::vip
tkulabeled::add .notes text  -label "Notes:" -height 4
pack .name .lang .age .vip .notes -fill x
tkulabeled::value .name "Ada"
set who [tkulabeled::value .name]
.CE
.SS Notes
.IP \(bu
\fBvalue\fR reads with one argument, writes with two (so an empty string is a valid value to set).
.IP \(bu
For \fBcheck\fR, \fBvalue\fR reflects the bound \fB\-variable\fR.
.IP \(bu
Pairs well with \fBtkutils::tkukeynav\fR (Return\-to\-next\-field) and \fBtkutils::tkuvalidate\fR (inline checks) on the inner \fBcontrol\fR.
.IP \(bu
Errors carry \fB{TKUTILS TKULABELED <REASON>}\fR (\fBTYPE\fR, \fBORIENT\fR, \fBNOWIDGET\fR, \fBARGS\fR).
.SS Demo
.CS
tclsh examples/demo-tkulabeled.tcl
.CE
